    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Don't be afraid of failures as you learn from them. Set your goals and keep going to achieve them,\" said mountaineer Samina Baig while telling the story of her expedition to K2, at the Aga Khan University's Faculty of Arts and Sciences Library lecture series Beyond the Shelves.",
